<title>ITALY: Italian April new car registrations up 52 pct.</title>
<headline>Italian April new car registrations up 52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian new car registrations rose 52.37 percent to 231,500 units in April, compared with 151,933 in April 1996, the Ministry of Transport said.</p>
<p>New registrations for the Fiat group alone rose 8.26 percent in April to 103,950 units, compared with 96,020 unitis in March 1997, the Ministry's figures showed.</p>
</text>
